## CHANGELOG

### [1.0.0] — initial release

* Aiogram 3 Telegram bot with role-based UX.
* FastAPI bridge with bearer-token EA authentication and 25 s long-poll.
* SQLite (aiosqlite) schema: `accounts`, `team_members`, `permissions`,
  `jobs`, `alerts`, `audit_log`, `sessions`.
* Trilingual UI (EN / JA / VI) with full key parity.
* Stranger lockout, per-user `setMyCommands`, and at-least-one-admin
  invariant.
* Confirmation flow for every destructive action; `PANIC` text gate for
  emergency close-all.
* Push-alert worker with role-filtered fan-out.
* Hardened systemd unit, nginx reverse-proxy template, multi-stage
  Dockerfile, docker-compose, daily DO Spaces backup script with
  encrypted retention (7 daily / 4 weekly / 12 monthly), and
  `rotate_token.py` CLI.
